# Vuka Ventures Website

Build a bold, minimalist, typography-led marketing site for **vukaventures.co**.

## Stack

- **Astro 5** — static site generation, islands only where needed (nav, form, filters)
- **Tailwind CSS v4** — utility layer mapped to Vuka design tokens
- **Medium** — headless CMS for `/our-thesis` and `/studio-journal` via RSS at build time
- **MDX content collections** — portfolio case studies with venture + client logos
- **TypeScript** — all `.astro` frontmatter and `src/lib/` utilities

