## Project layout

```
src/
  components/       # Atomic → composite (see vuka-components rule)
  layouts/          # BaseLayout, ArticleLayout, PathwayLayout
  pages/            # File-based routes matching IA
  content/
    portfolio/      # MDX case studies (not Medium)
  config/
    site.ts         # portfolioEnabled flag
  lib/              # medium.ts, portfolio.ts, tags.ts, seo.ts
  styles/           # global.css, fonts.css
public/
  fonts/            # Codec Pro TTF files (from design system)
  assets/
    portfolio/
      ventures/     # Venture logos (SVG)
      clients/      # Per-venture client logo folders
```

## Architecture principles

1. **Static-first** — pre-render all pages; revalidate on deploy webhook from Medium
2. **No React by default** — prefer `.astro` components; use `<script>` for interactivity
3. **Section-driven pages** — each IA section (H1, WD3, A2…) maps to one layout block
4. **Copy from docs** — never invent marketing copy; pull from `vuka-website-copy-complete.md`
5. **Portfolio hidden at launch** — `portfolioEnabled: false`; omit `/portfolio` from nav; no placeholder
6. **Portfolio = MDX + logos** — not Medium; venture logo on cards, client logos on case study only
7. **Redirects** — `/contact` → `/work-with-us`, `/apply` → `/what-we-do/founder-in-residence`, `/thesis` → `/our-thesis`

## CMS split

| Content | Source | Route |
|---------|--------|-------|
| Thesis | Medium (`thesis` tag) | `/our-thesis/[slug]` |
| Journal | Medium (`journal` tag) | `/studio-journal/[slug]` |
| Portfolio | MDX + `public/assets/portfolio/` | `/portfolio/[slug]` |

Fetch Medium via `astro-medium-loader` or RSS in `src/lib/medium.ts`. Portfolio via `getCollection('portfolio')` with `published: true` filter.

## Responsive breakpoints

```
sm: 640px   md: 768px   lg: 1024px   xl: 1280px   2xl: 1440px
```

Max content width: `1200px`. Section padding: `px-5 md:px-10 lg:px-10`. Hero type uses `clamp()`.

## Do not

- Use pure `#FFFFFF` or `#000000`
- Add gradients, background images, or emoji
- Use accelerator language (cohort, demo day, curriculum)
- Mix typefaces — Codec Pro only
- Create commits unless explicitly asked
